s, notes taken during or after, and any record
 identifying who was present.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">9. &nbsp;Any recurring=
 or periodic briefing document produced for the Governor or her senior staf=
f =97 daily or weekly issue summaries, constituent correspondence reports, =
agency issue reports, or equivalent =97 in which
 I, my correspondence, the Oregon Parks and Recreation Department's handlin=
g of it, or the archive at oprdvolunteerabuse.org appears.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">10. All communications=
