cting for the Kotek campaign, to the extent held on state systems or by sta=
te employees.</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal"><span style=3D"color:black">11. Any record describ=
