 or cite the specific exemption claimed for each record or portion withheld=
, as ORS 192.329(2) requires. If the
 Office is not the custodian of a category, please identify the custodian r=
ather than closing the request as to that category. ORS 192.311(2)(b).</spa=
n></p>
